      'Separate the senior version from the staff one explicitly, because one mentee is a senior story: at staff scope the question is whether you changed how growth happens beyond the person in front of you — a levelling rubric you wrote that the team now uses, a stretch-project pattern other leads copied, or the fact that you did this with [N] people over [multiple quarters] and can name the through-line. Say the number and say the horizon; "I mentored someone and they got promoted" is true of every good senior engineer in the loop.',
