      "Splits INP into input delay, processing time and presentation delay, each with its own fix",
      "Uses Long Animation Frames to attribute the slow frame to a script by name",
      "Yields with scheduler.yield() (feature-detected) or a transition after the visible update",
      "Tracks p75 per interaction target after the fix",
